      "repair_reason": "- [P2] Manual review is needed because the remaining action is maintainer selection of the permanent DeepSeek/Xiaomi cache strategy and acceptance of the provider-default compatibility impact.; Cleared: The diff changes provider payload shaping, config/types, docs, and tests; no new dependency, workflow, secret-handling, permission, install, or supply-chain concern was found. (sha=02f05e8233e1f5706f92e9c65f53b22408c4849c)",
      "review_summary": "The branch adds `compat.disableBoundaryAwareCache` to model compat/config/catalog surfaces, defaults it for DeepSeek/Xiaomi OpenAI-completions models, moves cache-boundary dynamic suffix text into the latest user message, and updates docs/tests.\n\nPR surface: Source +69, Tests +135, Docs +1. Total +205 across 12 files.\n\nReproducibility: yes. at source level: current main and v2026.6.11 strip the cache boundary before conversion, while the PR preserves it for the new compat path and includes live DeepSeek cache telemetry. I did not run a live DeepSeek request in this read-only review.",
